Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:55:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Include <ctime> in ByteBuffer.h

ByteBuffer.h uses time_t but relied on another header to bring it in. With musl (the phone's
server is built on Alpine) nothing else does, and files that include LootMgr.h first don't build.
---
 src/server/shared/Packets/ByteBuffer.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/server/shared/Packets/ByteBuffer.h b/src/server/shared/Packets/ByteBuffer.h
index 56b4da5de2..cea925ab0b 100644
--- a/src/server/shared/Packets/ByteBuffer.h
+++ b/src/server/shared/Packets/ByteBuffer.h
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@
 #include "Define.h"
 #include <array>
 #include <cstring>
+#include <ctime>
 #include <string>
 #include <vector>
 
